OL,3,AMore than 300 arrests at Palestine
OL,4,AAction support protest outside US
OL,5,Aembassy
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 300 people have been arrested
OL,8,Fduring a protest supporting the banned
OL,9,FPalestine Action group outside the US
OL,10,Fembassy, police have said.
OL,12,FHundreds of people gathered at Nine
OL,13,FElms in London on Saturday, with many
OL,14,Fholding signs reading phrases such as:
OL,15,F"I oppose genocide, I support Palestine
OL,16,FAction."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
