OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands gathered in Delhi for
OL,7,Fa rally demanding the resignation of
OL,8,FIndia's chief election commissioner
OL,9,Fover a controversial revision of voter
OL,10,Flists.
OL,12,FOrganised by the opposition INDIA bloc
OL,13,Fand led by Rahul Gandhi's Congress
OL,14,Fparty, the protest drew many of the
OL,15,Falliance's most prominent leaders in a
OL,16,Fshow of strength against Prime Minister
OL,17,FNarendra Modi's government.
OL,19,FProtesters waved flags and chanted
OL,20,F"Save the vote, save the country" and
OL,21,F"Vote thief, give up power".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
