OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the latest in a series of
OL,7,Fprotests over electoral roll revision
OL,8,Fthat the opposition says has removed
OL,9,Feligible voters to benefit the
OL,10,FBharatiya Janata Party. The BJP and the
OL,11,FElection Commission deny the
OL,12,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
